SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE
=====================

This MIT licence covers the SOURCE CODE of this repository: the application
logic, components, build scripts, tests, configuration, and the structure and
schema of the data files.

It does NOT cover the historical prose content. All narrative text under
src/data/ — article bodies, summaries, glossary entries, essays, exhibition
copy — is licensed separately under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
4.0 International. See LICENSE-CONTENT.

It does NOT cover third-party assets. Satellite map tiles (Esri) and
webfonts (Google Fonts) are fetched at runtime from their respective providers
and remain subject to their own terms. See docs/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.